(text "Pool heater probe override - ESP32-S3-Zero + 2x AQV252G PhotoMOS" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 10.16 10.16 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "687bd114-49c2-4ddf-b04f-c27d2750384f"))
(text "PROBE INPUT: divider R1 / probe (NTC). Calibrated: 13820 ohm = 32.0F, 2890 ohm = 96.3F (B=3696, R25=4444). ADC on GP1" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 106.68 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cffb8d7b-98cb-4c0f-8449-5063b6369a5b"))
(text "FAKE PROBE OUTPUT: firmware turns on exactly ONE relay. K1 (GP6) -> HOT resistor -> heater satisfied (OFF)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 106.68 76.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "272b8f77-7ba6-4c43-abda-1736764faf3f"))
(text "K2 (GP5) -> COLD resistor -> heater calls for heat (ON). Both off (board dead) = open sensor -> heater faults OFF." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 106.68 81.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "75833698-aaca-4e83-9fe9-bce027a2e503"))
(text "When switching, turn the new relay ON before turning the old one OFF (overlap reads hotter = safe)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 106.68 86.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "da9254ca-b3db-488d-ae1c-3b5d7a60d7d3"))
(text "As built: HOT R5 3.83k -> heater shows 89F, COLD R7 9.0k -> heater shows 50F. Heater setpoint 70F. R6/R8 = wire links." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 106.68 187.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3152146c-efd4-4bcb-87d9-23012105d0f4"))
(text "U1 powered from its own USB-C 5 V supply. No footprint assigned for U1 (perfboard build)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 106.68 193.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b810cef9-4297-4dfd-9765-e2015c20eb3a"))
